sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Attacker
    participant B as Browser/Victim
    participant S as Application Server
    A->>B: Attempts to make browser use a known session ID
    B->>S: Request with that session ID
    S-->>B: Anonymous session
    B->>S: Login using victim credentials
    Note over S: Vulnerable design keeps the same ID
    A->>S: Replays known session ID
    S-->>A: May gain victim session if ID was not rotated
    Note over S: Defense: regenerate session ID after authentication and privilege changes
